+## Checking against your budget
+
+The `budget` command shows how much you have spent in each category for a given
+month alongside the configured limit, so you can see at a glance where you are
+running over:
+
+```
+python -m tally.cli budget --month 2024-03
+```
+
+Budget limits are defined per category in `tally/config.py` under
+`CATEGORY_BUDGETS`. Edit that file to adjust the thresholds to your own numbers.
+
